Wizznic

Cursor keys  move the cursor, choose in menus
Ctrl  grab a brick (hold it and push left or right), choose in menus
Space  reset the bricks (start the level again)
Esc  pause and the menu, back
Alt  delete a letter (typing a name)
Editor: X  put a brick, Z  delete it, Space  save
1, 2  next, previous track (your own music)
Mouse  the menus and the game
